WEBVTT

00:13.680 --> 00:14.765
Where am I?

00:15.390 --> 00:17.059
I can't see a thing...

00:17.809 --> 00:19.311
What is this place?

00:32.157 --> 00:36.036
THE CALAMITY

00:37.913 --> 00:40.498
<i>I've lived my way full of shame</i>

00:40.499 --> 00:45.044
<i>"Envy" comes from the ways
of the eventual end</i>

00:45.045 --> 00:47.463
<i>The ambiguous balance</i>

00:47.464 --> 00:50.259
<i>I want to cut ties at once</i>

00:51.551 --> 00:53.094
<i>It's too late to back down now</i>

00:53.095 --> 00:54.345
<i>Before this senile body dies</i>

00:54.346 --> 00:56.097
<i>My shadow will fade away soon, but</i>

00:56.098 --> 00:58.307
<i>Even if I disappear, my journey won't stop</i>

00:58.308 --> 00:59.809
<i>Uncertain days, certain endings</i>

00:59.810 --> 01:01.477
<i>My stories fill the in-betweens</i>

01:01.478 --> 01:04.230
<i>Beyond the wall blocking my way,
there is a calm morning</i>

01:04.231 --> 01:08.527
<i>Like the rising sun,
I stand with the wind at my back</i>

01:08.652 --> 01:12.697
<i>A burst of hope?</i>

01:12.698 --> 01:14.991
<i>Break through an endless night</i>

01:14.992 --> 01:19.996
<i>Show the sun waiting
at the end of darkness</i>

01:19.997 --> 01:23.040
<i>The promise is yet to be fulfilled</i>

01:23.041 --> 01:26.627
<i>but I stand in solitude not to let it go</i>

01:26.628 --> 01:29.505
<i>At the moment,
I'm connecting numerous lights</i>

01:29.506 --> 01:33.218
<i>to form a constellation
that paves tomorrow</i>

01:33.885 --> 01:37.763
<i>Even if the rain clouds
hide the night sky away</i>

01:37.764 --> 01:41.226
<i>there certainly is a flame in my heart</i>

01:41.560 --> 01:46.398
<i>God is no longer reliable</i>

01:46.565 --> 01:51.278
<i>I glance up towards the silver lining</i>

01:51.403 --> 01:57.492
<i>The destiny of bursting fate</i>

01:57.617 --> 01:59.953
BLEACH: THOUSAND-YEAR BLOOD WAR

02:12.758 --> 02:16.845
Expend all of your power
and die, Ichigo!

02:18.263 --> 02:19.598
Santenkesshun!

02:22.809 --> 02:23.810
Shitenkoshun!!

02:24.811 --> 02:26.605
The power of rejection, eh?

02:26.813 --> 02:27.731
I...

02:28.231 --> 02:29.191
reject!

02:30.233 --> 02:31.485
You can't reject me completely.

02:38.533 --> 02:43.080
The same powers that flow
within Ichigo flow within me.

02:43.747 --> 02:47.959
So, you unconsciously
accept my attacks.

03:19.199 --> 03:20.075
Woman...

03:20.367 --> 03:21.868
Consider it an honor...

03:22.369 --> 03:26.415
that a mere human like you,
who overstepped her bounds,

03:26.706 --> 03:28.583
could even be here.

03:29.960 --> 03:31.086
I won't let you...

03:31.378 --> 03:32.379
hurt him.

03:35.882 --> 03:37.426
I will protect him!

03:42.681 --> 03:43.640
And that...

03:44.891 --> 03:45.892
is why...

03:47.811 --> 03:49.438
I reject!

04:04.536 --> 04:07.164
Getsugatensho!

04:13.086 --> 04:14.588
I will cut you down.

04:15.672 --> 04:17.466
Such hubris, Ichigo.

04:17.757 --> 04:20.635
To do that would be the same as
killing the world.

04:22.471 --> 04:26.892
For I've already become
the world itself!

04:27.684 --> 04:30.228
While I possess
His Majesty's powers,

04:30.771 --> 04:34.274
I can wield them as I please.

04:34.691 --> 04:37.736
This is the power that I hold
as his other half.

04:38.820 --> 04:44.117
Uryu Ishida, if you did indeed
survive His Majesty's Auswählen,

04:44.951 --> 04:48.997
then prove it once more
by surviving my powers.

05:04.262 --> 05:07.474
Your fight has been a contradiction
from the very beginning.

05:07.724 --> 05:09.100
You should have seen that already.

05:09.643 --> 05:12.312
You know just how fragile
the balance of this world is

05:12.562 --> 05:14.564
and how easily it can be shaken...

05:15.524 --> 05:18.985
Killing His Majesty,
who has become one with Soul King,

05:19.110 --> 05:22.656
would condemn
this world to its end.

05:41.049 --> 05:42.425
How pathetic.

05:48.306 --> 05:51.768
If we defeat Yhwach,
the world will crumble...

05:52.435 --> 05:54.604
I'm completely aware of that.

05:57.023 --> 05:57.983
Then why...?

05:58.149 --> 05:59.150
But...

06:00.193 --> 06:02.404
Kurosaki might say this...

06:03.321 --> 06:04.948
I'm still going to take you down.

06:05.699 --> 06:09.327
I know the people who have
always protected this world.

06:09.703 --> 06:13.623
You are trampling on the very thing
they want to protect.

06:15.208 --> 06:17.711
There are countless lives
I want to protect.

06:18.211 --> 06:23.133
I want to protect their feelings
and all that they hold dear.

06:23.925 --> 06:27.846
If that means destroying the world,
then so be it...

06:28.680 --> 06:29.723
Here I come.

06:30.640 --> 06:32.893
Getsuga Jujisho!

06:33.894 --> 06:35.353
Have you realized it yet?

06:37.230 --> 06:39.941
Even if you people can win
against His Majesty,

06:40.317 --> 06:41.776
now that the Soul King is gone,

06:42.277 --> 06:44.820
do you realize what will be
necessary to preserve

06:44.821 --> 06:46.239
the world as you know it?

06:52.329 --> 06:53.747
Even that didn't work...

06:54.623 --> 06:55.706
Ichigo...

06:55.707 --> 06:58.793
My son born in the darkness...

06:59.461 --> 07:01.421
You might be ignorant,

07:01.838 --> 07:04.299
but you understand everything
instinctually.

07:04.758 --> 07:06.842
And because
you understand everything,

07:06.843 --> 07:09.596
you hesitate to take me down.

07:11.723 --> 07:13.892
Ichibe Hyosube...

07:14.643 --> 07:17.312
Everything is happening exactly
according to his plan.

07:17.646 --> 07:19.731
He took you in, Ichigo Kurosaki...

07:19.856 --> 07:23.401
and gave you the Soul King's memories
and explained everything.

07:23.860 --> 07:27.489
He did it to judge
whether Ichigo Kurosaki

07:27.614 --> 07:29.824
was worthy of existence.

07:30.617 --> 07:31.826
You are a miracle.

07:32.285 --> 07:35.996
You are human, Soul Reaper,

07:35.997 --> 07:40.835
Hollow, Fullbringer, and Quincy.

07:41.419 --> 07:46.675
You likely never thought about
the true essence of your powers...

07:46.925 --> 07:50.053
Why do you clad yourself
in black?

07:50.637 --> 07:52.514
Black is the color of chaos...

07:52.764 --> 07:55.350
Chaos is the power of
the Soul King.

07:55.934 --> 07:57.811
Black—the color without color—

07:58.019 --> 08:00.230
is nothing less than
the Soul King's Spiritual Pressure.

08:00.939 --> 08:05.318
And the one who controls that black
is Ichibe Hyosube.

08:05.902 --> 08:10.490
I'm sure he said to you,
"Protect the Soul King."

08:12.117 --> 08:16.204
I'm sorry... I'm sorry...

08:30.677 --> 08:33.680
<i>You're the only one being taken
for a different reason.</i>

08:34.305 --> 08:36.724
<i>Are you a vessel
capable of withstanding</i>

08:36.725 --> 08:39.226
<i>the power that fills it,</i>

08:39.227 --> 08:41.146
<i>or are you a bowl that shatters?</i>

08:41.396 --> 08:46.359
<i>I was able to receive a tiny bit of
your power to restore my own body.</i>

08:46.735 --> 08:49.696
<i>Please protect the Soul King,
Ichigo!</i>

08:50.905 --> 08:53.324
I will tell you his true intent.

08:54.242 --> 08:59.914
Ichibe Hyosube intended to
install you as the next Soul King.

09:01.750 --> 09:02.584
No way!

09:03.084 --> 09:05.085
He was going to
make you a figurehead

09:05.086 --> 09:08.131
whose only purpose is
to preserve the Three Worlds,

09:08.548 --> 09:10.507
So a world with Soul Reapers

09:10.508 --> 09:12.761
as the pinnacle would be maintained.

09:13.595 --> 09:16.890
That is Ichibe Hyosube's
vision of "peace."

09:17.557 --> 09:20.852
For you, it may as well be "death."

09:25.857 --> 09:27.734
So what?

09:28.818 --> 09:30.236
So what?

09:30.737 --> 09:31.945
What?

09:31.946 --> 09:32.906
It's just...

09:33.573 --> 09:35.867
I figured that's what
Kurosaki would say.

09:36.785 --> 09:41.331
Why does it matter if
I become the Soul King or not?!

09:43.958 --> 09:45.794
What I know right now, is...

09:47.378 --> 09:51.716
Unless I take you down,
I'll have nothing to protect!

09:52.717 --> 09:54.385
Yhwach!

10:13.446 --> 10:15.322
What the hell is that monster?

10:15.323 --> 10:17.741
He's so strong, he made you
pee your pants a little, Hachi!

10:17.742 --> 10:20.120
I haven't peed my pants.

10:24.082 --> 10:25.375
Too easy!

10:25.792 --> 10:29.670
Is this all you Thirteen Court
Guard Squad captains can muster

10:29.671 --> 10:31.214
against my Miracle?

10:32.132 --> 10:36.594
I can already barely sense
your faint Spiritual Pressure.

10:37.220 --> 10:40.932
It'll be like stepping on ants
in the sand.

10:41.516 --> 10:43.726
It's close to impossible...

10:45.311 --> 10:47.605
That is exactly why I can find you!

10:47.772 --> 10:50.817
Did you think I wouldn't be able to
find you because it's impossible?

10:51.151 --> 10:53.820
It's a "Miracle" because
the impossible becomes possible!

10:54.112 --> 10:56.196
We weren't listening
to you earlier,

10:56.197 --> 11:00.577
so your "Miracle" is just
gibberish to us, baldy!

11:00.869 --> 11:02.953
I am not bald!

11:02.954 --> 11:04.706
What kinda comeback was that?!

11:06.833 --> 11:07.750
Are you being serious?!

11:10.837 --> 11:13.214
You think I'd fall for that?!

11:13.715 --> 11:17.302
Nah, I didn't.
Not if it was just me.

11:18.845 --> 11:20.096
Sakanade.

11:23.725 --> 11:25.727
The world flipped!

11:27.437 --> 11:29.105
Everything's upside-down.

11:35.820 --> 11:36.946
Now, everybody!

11:39.699 --> 11:42.243
I'll let you hear the Tritone

11:42.911 --> 11:44.412
Tekken Tachikaze!

11:44.704 --> 11:46.915
Super Mashiro Kick!

11:51.294 --> 11:53.588
Chocolate Bar Slider!

11:53.796 --> 11:55.422
Hifuki no Kozuchi!

11:55.423 --> 11:56.966
Nijuichijo Tonbokudari!

11:59.928 --> 12:00.887
It's over.

12:07.936 --> 12:08.937
We did it...

12:19.697 --> 12:20.740
Boy, oh boy...

12:21.074 --> 12:23.743
It'll never end at this rate.

12:24.327 --> 12:25.411
Oh, I know...

12:25.787 --> 12:27.455
I'll just drop this entire area

12:27.956 --> 12:30.375
along with them all.

12:35.672 --> 12:37.966
I can't allow you to let them fall.

12:43.638 --> 12:46.015
Stay frozen here forever.

12:46.849 --> 12:48.518
Who said that?

12:49.227 --> 12:52.105
Captain of Squad 10 of
the Thirteen Court Guard Squads,

12:52.689 --> 12:54.357
Toshiro Hitsugaya.

12:55.733 --> 12:56.858
Is that so?

12:56.859 --> 13:01.906
I am Stern Ritter Gerard Valkyrie
of the Royal Guards.

13:05.785 --> 13:07.704
Let's be friends!

13:08.788 --> 13:09.914
Sorry.

13:10.915 --> 13:12.917
I didn't come here to be friends.

13:14.961 --> 13:15.920
Bankai.

13:16.796 --> 13:18.631
Daiguren Hyorinmaru.

13:25.888 --> 13:26.889
Shiro...

13:33.604 --> 13:34.897
I see...

13:41.404 --> 13:43.406
What a childish answer...

13:46.117 --> 13:47.118
Kurosaki!

13:48.953 --> 13:50.662
So it falls on the parent

13:50.663 --> 13:52.707
to correct the child's error,
I suppose.

14:09.807 --> 14:11.059
<i>He's so fast...</i>

14:11.642 --> 14:13.436
<i>I can't follow
Kurosaki's movements...!</i>

14:40.880 --> 14:42.173
Kurosaki, wait!

14:42.340 --> 14:44.467
Calm down for a second!

15:00.399 --> 15:01.776
I don't understand...

15:02.026 --> 15:03.986
Why rush to your death?

15:08.324 --> 15:11.869
Are you reluctant to show me
all of your power?

15:12.120 --> 15:15.873
Are you afraid I'll take it,
if you show it to me?

15:16.666 --> 15:19.085
But is that all right, Ichigo?

15:19.418 --> 15:21.379
If you die here,

15:21.629 --> 15:24.423
both the World of the Living and
Soul Society are done.

15:24.882 --> 15:26.509
I will end them.

15:27.009 --> 15:28.970
Are you okay with that, Ichigo?

15:37.770 --> 15:38.771
Look.

15:38.896 --> 15:42.024
Your friend is saying
that must not happen.

15:42.525 --> 15:46.279
She's telling you to heal
your wounds and fight.

15:46.571 --> 15:50.867
You never had a choice
to begin with.

15:51.409 --> 15:52.743
Answer, Ichigo!

15:53.161 --> 15:55.246
To the voices of the powerless.

15:56.664 --> 15:58.331
For the weak...

15:58.332 --> 16:01.961
who, without you,
can barely breathe...

16:03.838 --> 16:04.714
Stand up.

16:06.549 --> 16:07.717
Fight.

16:08.759 --> 16:10.344
And die!

16:32.450 --> 16:34.493
Thanks, Inoue.

16:35.328 --> 16:36.162
Sure,

16:36.621 --> 16:40.833
I barely grabbed your clothes...
but you stopped, Kurosaki.

16:41.834 --> 16:42.793
When you looked back,

16:43.002 --> 16:45.254
I didn't see the face of a person
who had lost himself.

16:45.838 --> 16:48.925
I knew you had something in mind.

16:49.759 --> 16:50.760
Yeah...

16:51.594 --> 16:53.888
There was a guy I wanted to wake up

16:54.055 --> 16:55.973
by pumping in some
Quincy Spiritual Pressure.

16:57.808 --> 16:58.768
<i>His sword...</i>

16:59.143 --> 17:00.269
<i>is turning white...</i>

17:05.650 --> 17:06.859
I see...

17:07.109 --> 17:09.362
So that's what
you were trying to do.

17:18.412 --> 17:19.704
<i>Retracing memories</i>

17:19.705 --> 17:23.416
<i>An unexpected gaze</i>

17:23.417 --> 17:25.919
<i>The world I didn't want</i>

17:25.920 --> 17:27.837
<i>I've started breaking it down</i>

17:27.838 --> 17:30.549
<i>Lean on each other and face forward</i>

17:30.550 --> 17:33.260
<i>I want to change my fate</i>

17:33.261 --> 17:36.429
<i>All the voices shout</i>

17:36.430 --> 17:38.474
<i>The sound rang out</i>

17:54.115 --> 17:56.658
<i>I saw countless scattered shadows</i>

17:56.659 --> 17:58.995
<i>and I laughed</i>

17:59.161 --> 18:01.454
<i>A world that's lost its color</i>

18:01.455 --> 18:03.832
<i>I'll illuminate it again</i>

18:03.833 --> 18:06.501
<i>Broken and lamenting</i>

18:06.502 --> 18:09.129
<i>The end of the dream</i>

18:09.130 --> 18:13.550
<i>Shaking free from it over and over again
with a still-connected heart</i>

18:13.551 --> 18:19.222
<i>I'll protect today,
the path I've walked all this time</i>

18:19.223 --> 18:20.349
<i>Break it</i>

18:20.474 --> 18:23.018
<i>Tear the future apart, call my name</i>

18:23.019 --> 18:25.979
<i>Turn your back on your predetermined past</i>

18:25.980 --> 18:28.732
<i>Today keeps playing with fate</i>

18:28.733 --> 18:30.900
<i>Reclaim it here and now</i>

18:30.901 --> 18:33.445
<i>To the ends of the earth, an unseen dream</i>

18:33.446 --> 18:36.239
<i>With eyes that know the strength
that lies in words</i>

18:36.240 --> 18:39.367
<i>Notice the distorted spiral</i>

18:39.368 --> 18:42.662
<i>My fate has been set in motion</i>

18:42.663 --> 18:46.667
BLEACH: THOUSAND-YEAR BLOOD WAR

18:52.715 --> 18:54.300
Okay, now for the finishing move.

18:59.138 --> 19:01.015
It couldn't even stop him
for a moment...

19:01.182 --> 19:02.683
He's a tough bastard.

19:02.933 --> 19:08.397
Did you think you could stop me
with these ice tricks?

19:15.696 --> 19:16.739
That saved me...

19:20.785 --> 19:22.953
I don't like The Miracle,

19:24.038 --> 19:25.081
but it's powerful.

19:25.831 --> 19:26.832
Agreed.

19:27.124 --> 19:29.751
He's a difficult opponent
to take on one-on-one.

19:29.752 --> 19:30.753
Let me help.

19:31.003 --> 19:32.004
Understood.

19:32.338 --> 19:34.297
Given the difference in height,

19:34.298 --> 19:36.801
two against one
wouldn't be cowardly...

19:38.386 --> 19:39.844
Why are you looking at me
like that?

19:39.845 --> 19:42.848
You wanna say that I'm always
at a height disadvantage?

19:43.974 --> 19:45.059
No, of course not...

19:45.267 --> 19:47.395
That's... not my intent.

19:48.396 --> 19:50.271
- Sorry.
- Then why'd you apologize?!

19:50.272 --> 19:52.816
You hesitated,
and then apologized anyway!

19:52.817 --> 19:53.734
Look at me!

19:58.989 --> 20:00.282
What's this?

20:00.491 --> 20:03.494
Captain classes
all getting obliterated together?

20:04.829 --> 20:05.788
So pathetic!

20:06.956 --> 20:08.791
- Here comes trouble...
- Here comes trouble...

20:11.627 --> 20:14.755
My... my right hand!

20:15.881 --> 20:18.092
Is stronger!

20:18.551 --> 20:20.720
What's that?
What just happened?!

20:20.970 --> 20:22.471
That's his power.

20:22.680 --> 20:25.474
Any injured area on his body
grows bigger and stronger.

20:25.808 --> 20:27.101
I see.

20:27.268 --> 20:30.563
That means he wasn't this big
from the start.

20:31.856 --> 20:32.857
What?

20:32.982 --> 20:34.692
If you've got something to say,
just say it!

20:35.276 --> 20:36.110
I don't.

20:36.652 --> 20:37.820
You're being hyper-sensitive.

20:38.779 --> 20:39.780
How fun!

20:40.531 --> 20:45.077
Let's find out what happens if
we dice him up into pieces!

20:45.453 --> 20:46.620
That idiot!

20:50.249 --> 20:51.791
What do you think you're doing?

20:51.792 --> 20:55.629
You woulda been sliced in two
if I hadn't held back!

20:55.838 --> 20:57.798
You're more considerate
than I thought.

20:58.257 --> 21:00.426
Now put a little more thought
into it...

21:00.926 --> 21:03.052
Huh? What are you talking about?

21:03.053 --> 21:07.391
What will happen if we make him
any bigger, and he falls?

21:07.641 --> 21:09.058
Nothing.

21:09.059 --> 21:11.771
I'll fall with him and slice him up
on the way down.

21:12.104 --> 21:14.940
If someone with all that mass
falls from this height,

21:15.107 --> 21:17.109
Seireitei will be destroyed!

21:34.084 --> 21:36.128
Stop with the quibbling!

21:36.504 --> 21:38.797
So in other words,
I just have to stop toying with him

21:38.798 --> 21:41.217
and go straight to cracking
his head open, right?

21:43.719 --> 21:44.553
Zaraki!

21:46.972 --> 21:48.765
You made me fall over.

21:48.766 --> 21:50.267
You're strong...

21:51.769 --> 21:54.605
I hate to be cruel,
but you leave me no choice.

21:55.022 --> 21:58.108
A powerful embodiment of darkness
such as yourself

21:58.442 --> 22:01.487
shall become rust on my Hoffnung.

22:02.321 --> 22:04.782
Can't believe I couldn't cut you.

22:04.949 --> 22:07.910
A tough shield
and a tough body, huh?

22:08.828 --> 22:10.788
Makes me wanna cut you even more.

22:11.789 --> 22:12.623
Drink...

22:15.417 --> 22:16.752
Nozarashi.

22:17.753 --> 22:18.921
What is that?

22:19.213 --> 22:20.130
His Shikai?

22:20.756 --> 22:22.591
When did Zaraki...?

22:23.217 --> 22:27.805
So, his sword wasn't
a constant-release type.

22:28.389 --> 22:29.472
No...

22:29.473 --> 22:33.059
Perhaps a constant-release type

22:33.060 --> 22:34.895
never existed in the first place...

22:50.786 --> 22:51.745
You fool!

22:52.162 --> 22:54.915
You chipped my Hoffnung!

23:00.588 --> 23:02.256
Senbonzakura Kageyoshi.

23:02.882 --> 23:03.883
Hyoryusenbi...

23:06.385 --> 23:07.386
Zekku!

23:18.022 --> 23:20.733
Do you wish that badly for despair?

23:21.483 --> 23:24.278
What's this?
What's happening?

23:24.820 --> 23:26.155
What's puzzling you?

23:26.572 --> 23:28.282
My power is The Miracle.

23:28.574 --> 23:31.869
The Miracle turns
the people's wishes into reality.

23:32.286 --> 23:36.957
My indestructible body is enlarged
by the people's fears.

23:37.082 --> 23:40.878
Hoffnung is forged from
the hopes of the people.

23:41.128 --> 23:44.006
When it shatters,
